    <maml:description>
      <maml:para>Returns values of variables from the script scope of the IdentityCommand.UserPortal module.</maml:para>
      <maml:para>This command can be used to examine details usually contained in the script scope of the module.</maml:para>
      <maml:para>Useful data like the last command, last command results and session elapsed time are returned by the command.</maml:para>
    </maml:description>
